msgstr "元组 `(Double, Double)`，其中："

#: manual/api/deriv.md:20
#: manual/api/deriv.md:54
#: manual/api/deriv.md:88
msgid "The first value is the estimated derivative at `x`."
msgstr "第一个值为 `x` 处的导数估计值。"

#: manual/api/deriv.md:21
#: manual/api/deriv.md:55
#: manual/api/deriv.md:89
msgid "The second value is the total estimated error, combining truncation and round-off errors."
msgstr "第二个值为总估计误差（包含截断误差和舍入误差）。"

#: manual/api/deriv.md:23
#: manual/api/deriv.md:57
#: manual/api/deriv.md:91
#: manual/api/diff.md:23
#: manual/api/diff.md:80
msgid "**Example Usage:**"
msgstr "**示例：**"

#: manual/api/deriv.md:33
#: manual/api/deriv.md:67
#: manual/api/deriv.md:101
