#: manual/api/diff.md:58
#: manual/api/diff.md:90
msgid "**Notes:**"
msgstr "**注意事项：**"

#: manual/api/deriv.md:35
msgid "The method **automatically adjusts the step size** to achieve the best accuracy."
msgstr "方法**自动调整步长**以优化精度。"

#: manual/api/deriv.md:36
msgid "Works well for smooth functions but may be **less accurate near discontinuities**."
msgstr "对平滑函数效果良好，但在不连续点附近**精度可能下降**。"

#: manual/api/deriv.md:37
msgid "Compared to a simple 2-point method, this approach significantly reduces numerical errors."
msgstr "相比简单的两点法，此方法显著降低了数值误差。"

#: manual/api/deriv.md:41
msgid "**Description:** Computes the derivative of the function `f` at point `x` using an **adaptive forward difference method**, which optimizes step size to minimize truncation and round-off errors."
msgstr ""
"**描述：**\\\n"
"使用**自适应前向差分法**计算函数 `f` 在点 `x` 处的导数，通过优化步长最小化截断和舍入误差。"

#: manual/api/deriv.md:69
msgid "The method **automatically refines the step size** for better accuracy."
msgstr "方法**自动优化步长**以提高精度。"

#: manual/api/deriv.md:70
msgid "Compared to basic forward difference methods, this approach **significantly reduces numerical errors**."
msgstr "相比基础前向差分法，此方法**显著减少数值误差**。"

#: manual/api/deriv.md:71
msgid "Works well for smooth functions but may be **less accurate for functions with sharp changes or discontinuities**."
msgstr "对平滑函数效果良好，但对于存在剧烈变化或不连续点的函数**精度可能下降**。"

#: manual/api/deriv.md:72
msgid "This method is especially useful when evaluating derivatives at boundaries where central differences are not feasible."
msgstr "适用于边界点求导（此时中心差分法不可用）。"

#: manual/api/deriv.md:76
msgid "**Description:** Computes the derivative of the function `f` at point `x` using an **adaptive backward difference method**, which mirrors forward differentiation but with a negative step size."
msgstr ""
"**描述：**\\\n"
"使用**自适应后向差分法**计算函数 `f` 在点 `x` 处的导数，原理与前向差分法相同但步长为负。"

#: manual/api/deriv.md:85
msgid "**Returns:** A tuple `(Double, Double)`, where:"
msgstr ""
"**返回值：**\\\n"
"元组 `(Double, Double)`："

#: manual/api/deriv.md:103
msgid "The method **automatically refines the step size** to optimize accuracy."
msgstr "方法**自动优化步长**以提高精度。"

#: manual/api/deriv.md:104
msgid "Suitable for cases where **backward differences** are preferred, such as differentiation near the upper boundary of a dataset."
msgstr "适用于数据集的**上边界附近求导**。"

#: manual/api/deriv.md:105
msgid "Shares the same numerical advantages as `deriv_forward`, significantly reducing numerical errors compared to simple finite differences."
msgstr "与 `deriv_forward` 具有相同的数值优势，相比简单有限差分显著降低数值误差。"

#: manual/api/diff.md:1
msgid "diff API"
msgstr "diff API"

#: manual/api/diff.md:3
msgid "The `diff` package estimates the derivative of a function at a point without a step size from the caller: the step is derived from machine precision and the local behaviour of the function. Each function returns the estimate together with an error bound."
msgstr "`diff` 包估计函数在某一点处的导数，无需调用者提供步长：步长由机器精度和函数的局部性态确定。每个函数都会同时返回估计值和误差界。"

#: manual/api/diff.md:7
#: manual/api/diff.md:42
#: manual/api/diff.md:64
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: manual/api/diff.md:9
msgid "Computes the numerical derivative of a function at a given point using the backward difference method with adaptive step size."
msgstr "使用自适应步长的后向差分法计算函数在给定点的数值导数。"

#: manual/api/diff.md:13
#: manual/api/diff.md:48
#: manual/api/diff.md:70
msgid "`f: Func_Math` — A function that takes a `Double` and Returns: a `Double`. The function to be differentiated."
msgstr "`f: Func_Math` — 输入 `Double` 类型值并返回 `Double` 的数学函数。"

#: manual/api/diff.md:14
#: manual/api/diff.md:49
#: manual/api/diff.md:71
msgid "`x: Double` — The point at which to compute the derivative."
msgstr "`x: Double` — 求导点的位置。"

#: manual/api/diff.md:20
msgid "The first value is the estimated derivative value using backward difference approximation."
msgstr "第一个值为后向差分导数估计值。"

#: manual/api/diff.md:21
#: manual/api/diff.md:56
#: manual/api/diff.md:78
msgid "The second value is the estimated absolute error of the computation."
msgstr "第二个值为计算的绝对误差估计值。"

#: manual/api/diff.md:35
msgid "The function evaluates the given function at three backward points using an adaptive step size."
msgstr "方法使用三个后向点自适应计算导数。"

#: manual/api/diff.md:36
msgid "It applies Neville’s recursion to compute divided differences and estimate the derivative."
msgstr "应用 Neville 递归法计算差分并估计误差。"

#: manual/api/diff.md:37
msgid "The method includes an error estimation based on the second-order divided difference."
msgstr "该方法包含基于二阶差商的误差估计。"

#: manual/api/diff.md:38
msgid "If `h` is too large, accuracy may decrease; if too small, numerical precision issues may arise."
msgstr "步长 `h` 过大可能降低精度，过小可能导致数值精度问题。"

#: manual/api/diff.md:44
msgid "Computes the numerical derivative of a function at a given point using the forward difference method with adaptive step size."
msgstr "使用自适应步长的前向差分法计算函数在给定点的数值导数。"

#: manual/api/diff.md:55
msgid "The first value is the estimated derivative value using forward difference approximation."
msgstr "第一个值为前向差分导数估计值。"

#: manual/api/diff.md:60
msgid "The function evaluates the given function at three forward points to choose the step size, so it only needs values of `f` at and above `x`."
msgstr "该函数在三个前向点上对给定函数求值以确定步长，因此只需要 `f` 在 `x` 及其右侧的取值。"

#: manual/api/diff.md:66
msgid "Computes the numerical derivative of a function at a given point using the central difference method with adaptive step size."
msgstr "使用自适应步长的中心差分法计算函数在给定点的数值导数。"

#: manual/api/diff.md:77
msgid "The first value is the estimated derivative value using central difference approximation."
msgstr "第一个值为中心差分导数估计值。"

#: manual/api/diff.md:92
msgid "The function evaluates the given function at four points around `x` to choose the step size."
msgstr "该函数在 `x` 附近的四个点上对给定函数求值以确定步长。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:1
msgid "integration API"
msgstr "integration API"

#: manual/api/integration.md:3
msgid "The `integration` package computes definite integrals of a `Func_Math` over a finite interval $[a, b]$ with Gauss–Kronrod quadrature. It provides the basic Gauss–Kronrod rules, an adaptive integrator that subdivides the interval, and a non-adaptive integrator that raises the order of the rule."
msgstr "`integration` 包使用 Gauss–Kronrod 求积法计算 `Func_Math` 在有限区间 $[a, b]$ 上的定积分。它提供基本的 Gauss–Kronrod 求积公式、通过细分区间工作的自适应积分器，以及通过提高求积公式阶数工作的非自适应积分器。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:5
msgid "Gauss–Kronrod rules"
msgstr "Gauss–Kronrod 求积公式"

#: manual/api/integration.md:9
msgid "Each function applies one Gauss–Kronrod rule to `f` on $[a, b]$; the number in the name is the number of Kronrod points."
msgstr "每个函数在 $[a, b]$ 上对 `f` 应用一个 Gauss–Kronrod 求积公式；名称中的数字是 Kronrod 节点数。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:20
msgid "The result is the tuple `(result, result_abs, result_asc, error)`:"
msgstr "结果是元组 `(result, result_abs, result_asc, error)`："

#: manual/api/integration.md:22
#: manual/api/integration.md:99
#: manual/api/internal.md:9
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: manual/api/integration.md:24
msgid "The Kronrod approximation of the integral of `f`."
msgstr "`f` 的积分的 Kronrod 近似值。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:25
msgid "The same rule applied to $\\lvert f \\rvert$."
msgstr "对 $\\lvert f \\rvert$ 应用同一求积公式的结果。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:26
msgid "The same rule applied to $\\lvert f - \\bar f \\rvert$, where $\\bar f$ is the mean value of `f` on the interval; it measures how much `f` varies."
msgstr "对 $\\lvert f - \\bar f \\rvert$ 应用同一求积公式的结果，其中 $\\bar f$ 是 `f` 在区间上的平均值；它衡量 `f` 的变化程度。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:27
msgid "The difference between the Kronrod and the embedded Gauss approximation, rescaled with `rescale_error`."
msgstr "Kronrod 近似与内嵌 Gauss 近似之差，经 `rescale_error` 重新缩放。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:29
msgid "Every rule has the type `Quad_GK` from the `basic` package, so it can be passed to `adap_quad_gk`."
msgstr "每个求积公式的类型都是 `basic` 包中的 `Quad_GK`，因此可以传给 `adap_quad_gk`。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:33
msgid "`rescale_error` turns the raw difference between two quadrature approximations into a conservative error estimate."
msgstr "`rescale_error` 将两个求积近似值之间的原始差值转换为保守的误差估计。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:39
msgid "`rescale_error(err, result_abs, result_asc)` scales $\\lvert err \\rvert$ to $result\\_asc \\cdot \\min(1, (200 \\lvert err \\rvert / result\\_asc)^{3/2})$ when both are non-zero, and never returns less than $50\\,\\varepsilon \\cdot result\\_abs$, where $\\varepsilon$ is the machine epsilon of `Double`. This is the error heuristic of QUADPACK."
msgstr "当两者均非零时，`rescale_error(err, result_abs, result_asc)` 将 $\\lvert err \\rvert$ 缩放为 $result\\_asc \\cdot \\min(1, (200 \\lvert err \\rvert / result\\_asc)^{3/2})$，且返回值不小于 $50\\,\\varepsilon \\cdot result\\_abs$，其中 $\\varepsilon$ 是 `Double` 的机器精度。这是 QUADPACK 的误差启发式方法。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:41
msgid "Integrators"
msgstr "积分器"

#: manual/api/integration.md:45
msgid "`adap_quad_gk` integrates `f` over $[a, b]$ adaptively: it bisects the subinterval with the largest error until the total error meets the tolerance."
msgstr "`adap_quad_gk` 在 $[a, b]$ 上自适应地对 `f` 积分：它不断二分误差最大的子区间，直到总误差满足容差。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:51
msgid "`adap_quad_gk(f, q, a, b, epsabs, epsrel, limit)` applies the rule `q`, for example `kronrod_r21`, to each subinterval. The computation stops successfully when the estimated absolute error is at most $\\max(epsabs, epsrel \\cdot \\lvert I \\rvert)$, where $I$ is the current integral estimate. `limit` is the maximum number of subintervals."
msgstr "`adap_quad_gk(f, q, a, b, epsabs, epsrel, limit)` 对每个子区间应用求积公式 `q`（例如 `kronrod_r21`）。当估计的绝对误差不超过 $\\max(epsabs, epsrel \\cdot \\lvert I \\rvert)$ 时计算成功结束，其中 $I$ 为当前的积分估计值。`limit` 是子区间的最大数量。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:53
msgid "The result is `Ok((integral, error, OK))` on success. Otherwise it is `Err(code)`:"
msgstr "成功时结果为 `Ok((integral, error, OK))`，否则为 `Err(code)`："

#: manual/api/integration.md:55
msgid "Code"
msgstr "代码"

#: manual/api/integration.md:55
msgid "Cause"
msgstr "原因"

#: manual/api/integration.md:57
msgid "`epsabs` is not positive and `epsrel` is smaller than the machine epsilon or $0.5 \\cdot 10^{-28}$."
msgstr "`epsabs` 不为正，且 `epsrel` 小于机器精度或 $0.5 \\cdot 10^{-28}$。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:58
msgid "Roundoff error prevents the requested tolerance from being reached."
msgstr "舍入误差使得无法达到所要求的容差。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:59
msgid "A subinterval became too small to bisect, which suggests a singularity or a highly oscillatory integrand."
msgstr "某个子区间已小到无法再二分，这表明被积函数可能存在奇点或剧烈振荡。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:60
msgid "`limit` subintervals were used before the tolerance was reached."
msgstr "在达到容差之前已用完 `limit` 个子区间。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:64
msgid "`non_adap_quad_gk` integrates `f` over $[a, b]$ with Gauss–Kronrod rules of increasing order, without subdividing the interval."
msgstr "`non_adap_quad_gk` 使用阶数递增的 Gauss–Kronrod 求积公式在 $[a, b]$ 上对 `f` 积分，不细分区间。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:70
msgid "`non_adap_quad_gk(f, a, b, epsabs, epsrel)` tries the 21-, 43- and 87-point rules in turn and returns as soon as the estimated error is below `epsabs` or below `epsrel` times the absolute value of the result. The result is `Ok((integral, error, neval))`, where `neval` is the number of function evaluations used (21, 43 or 87). It is `Err(E_BAD_TOL)` for invalid tolerances, as in `adap_quad_gk`, and `Err(E_FAILED)` when even the 87-point rule does not reach the tolerance."
msgstr "`non_adap_quad_gk(f, a, b, epsabs, epsrel)` 依次尝试 21 点、43 点和 87 点求积公式，一旦估计误差小于 `epsabs` 或小于 `epsrel` 乘以结果的绝对值便立即返回。结果为 `Ok((integral, error, neval))`，其中 `neval` 是所用的函数求值次数（21、43 或 87）。容差非法时（与 `adap_quad_gk` 相同）结果为 `Err(E_BAD_TOL)`；即使 87 点公式也达不到容差时结果为 `Err(E_FAILED)`。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:82
msgid "Error codes"
msgstr "错误码"

#: manual/api/integration.md:86
msgid "`ErrCode` reports the outcome of an integration."
msgstr "`ErrCode` 报告积分的结果状态。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:99
msgid "Constructor"
msgstr "构造器"

#: manual/api/integration.md:101
msgid "The integration succeeded."
msgstr "积分成功。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:102
msgid "Unexpected roundoff error."
msgstr "出现意外的舍入误差。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:103
msgid "Possible singularity or highly oscillatory integrand."
msgstr "被积函数可能存在奇点或剧烈振荡。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:104
msgid "Maximum number of subdivisions reached."
msgstr "已达到最大细分次数。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:105
msgid "General failure."
msgstr "一般性失败。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:106
msgid "Invalid tolerance parameters."
msgstr "容差参数非法。"

#: manual/api/integration.md:108
msgid "`ErrCode` implements `Eq`, so a result code can be compared with a constructor."
msgstr "`ErrCode` 实现了 `Eq`，因此可以将结果码与构造器进行比较。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:1
msgid "internal API"
msgstr "internal API"

#: manual/api/internal.md:3
msgid "The `internal` package holds the machine constants that the other packages use to choose step sizes and to bound roundoff error. It contains no functions. The constants are those of `gsl_machine.h` in the GNU Scientific Library."
msgstr "`internal` 包存放其他包用来选择步长和界定舍入误差的机器常量，不包含任何函数。这些常量与 GNU Scientific Library 中 `gsl_machine.h` 的常量一致。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:5
msgid "Machine constants"
msgstr "机器常量"

#: manual/api/internal.md:7
msgid "Every constant is a `Double` named `machine_<prefix><quantity>`. The quantity names a limit of a floating-point format:"
msgstr "每个常量都是名为 `machine_<prefix><quantity>` 的 `Double`。其中 quantity 表示某种浮点格式的一个极限值："

#: manual/api/internal.md:9
msgid "Quantity"
msgstr "量"

#: manual/api/internal.md:11
msgid "The machine epsilon of double precision, $2^{-52} \\approx 2.22 \\cdot 10^{-16}$."
msgstr "双精度的机器精度，$2^{-52} \\approx 2.22 \\cdot 10^{-16}$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:12
msgid "The smallest positive normal double, $\\approx 2.23 \\cdot 10^{-308}$."
msgstr "最小的正规格化双精度数，$\\approx 2.23 \\cdot 10^{-308}$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:13
msgid "The largest finite double, $\\approx 1.80 \\cdot 10^{308}$."
msgstr "最大的有限双精度数，$\\approx 1.80 \\cdot 10^{308}$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:14
msgid "The machine epsilon of single precision, $2^{-23}$."
msgstr "单精度的机器精度，$2^{-23}$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:15
msgid "The smallest positive normal single-precision value."
msgstr "最小的正规格化单精度数。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:16
msgid "The largest finite single-precision value."
msgstr "最大的有限单精度数。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:17
msgid "The machine epsilon of the short float format of GSL, $2^{-11}$."
msgstr "GSL 短浮点格式的机器精度，$2^{-11}$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:18
msgid "The rounded machine tolerances of `GSL_MACH_EPS`, which exist only with a prefix."
msgstr "`GSL_MACH_EPS` 系列中取整后的机器容差，仅以带前缀的形式存在。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:20
msgid "The prefix names a function of that quantity:"
msgstr "前缀表示对该量所取的函数："

#: manual/api/internal.md:22
msgid "Prefix"
msgstr "前缀"

#: manual/api/internal.md:22
msgid "Available for"
msgstr "适用于"

#: manual/api/internal.md:24
msgid "none"
msgstr "无"

#: manual/api/internal.md:24
msgid "the quantity itself"
msgstr "该量本身"

#: manual/api/internal.md:25
msgid "its square root"
msgstr "其平方根"

#: manual/api/internal.md:25
#: manual/api/internal.md:26
#: manual/api/internal.md:27
msgid "all quantities"
msgstr "所有量"

#: manual/api/internal.md:26
msgid "`root_3_` to `root_6_`"
msgstr "`root_3_` 至 `root_6_`"

#: manual/api/internal.md:26
msgid "its third to sixth root"
msgstr "其三次至六次方根"

#: manual/api/internal.md:27
msgid "its natural logarithm"
msgstr "其自然对数"

#: manual/api/internal.md:29
msgid "For example, `machine_sqrt_dbl_epsilon` is $\\sqrt{\\varepsilon} \\approx 1.49 \\cdot 10^{-8}$ and `machine_log_dbl_max` is $\\ln(\\text{dbl\\_max}) \\approx 709.78$. The rounded `eps` values are `machine_sqrt_eps` ($3.2 \\cdot 10^{-8}$), `machine_root_3_eps` ($10^{-5}$), `machine_root_4_eps` ($1.78 \\cdot 10^{-4}$), `machine_root_5_eps` ($10^{-3}$), `machine_root_6_eps` ($3.16 \\cdot 10^{-3}$) and `machine_log_eps` ($-34.54$)."
msgstr "例如，`machine_sqrt_dbl_epsilon` 为 $\\sqrt{\\varepsilon} \\approx 1.49 \\cdot 10^{-8}$，`machine_log_dbl_max` 为 $\\ln(\\text{dbl\\_max}) \\approx 709.78$。取整后的 `eps` 值为 `machine_sqrt_eps`（$3.2 \\cdot 10^{-8}$）、`machine_root_3_eps`（$10^{-5}$）、`machine_root_4_eps`（$1.78 \\cdot 10^{-4}$）、`machine_root_5_eps`（$10^{-3}$）、`machine_root_6_eps`（$3.16 \\cdot 10^{-3}$）和 `machine_log_eps`（$-34.54$）。"

#: manual/contributing.md:1
msgid "Contribution guidelines"
msgstr "贡献规范"

#: manual/contributing.md:3
msgid "To contributors"
msgstr "致贡献者"

#: manual/contributing.md:5
msgid "We warmly welcome developers familiar with various scientific computing libraries related to numerical calculus to join the project, contribute code, and share their valuable experiences. At the same time, we encourage beginners to learn and master numerical methods related to calculus by participating in development and improving documentation. In this project, we hope that both experienced developers and beginners can find contribution goals that interest them by reviewing the project's documentation, tables, and code examples."
msgstr "我们热烈欢迎熟悉各类微积分数值求解相关科学计算库的开发者加入本项目，贡献代码并分享宝贵的经验。同时，我们鼓励初学者通过参与开发和改进文档来学习和掌握微积分相关的数值方法。在本项目中，我们希望无论是有经验的开发者还是初学者，都能通过查阅项目文档、示例和代码找到自己感兴趣的贡献目标。"

#: manual/contributing.md:7
msgid "We sincerely thank all the developers who have contributed to this project. Whether through submitting code, improving documentation, or providing valuable feedback, every effort you make helps to make this project better. Your enthusiasm and wisdom in the development process continually drive the project forward, and bring more opportunities for collaboration within the community. We appreciate your support and dedication, and we look forward to achieving more together, driving this project toward an even brighter future!"
msgstr "我们衷心感谢所有为本项目做出贡献的开发者。无论是提交代码、完善文档，还是提供宝贵的反馈，你的每一份努力都让这个项目变得更好。你们在开发过程中的热情与智慧不断推动项目前进，也为社区带来了更多合作的机会。感谢你们的支持与付出，期待与大家携手取得更多成果，让这个项目迎来更加光明的未来！"

#: manual/contributing.md:9
msgid "1. Code style"
msgstr "1. 代码风格"

#: manual/contributing.md:11
msgid "The project follows the formatting style enforced by the MoonBit Toolchain. Format your code automatically using the following command:"
msgstr "统一采用 MoonBit Toolchain 的格式化风格，通过运行以下命令来自动格式化代码。"

#: manual/contributing.md:17
msgid "Ensure that you run `moon fmt` before committing your code to maintain consistency."
msgstr "请确保在提交代码之前，使用 `moon fmt` 格式化代码，以保持一致的代码风格。"

#: manual/contributing.md:19
msgid "Alternatively, you can use the `ready_to_pr.sh` script to automatically format the code, run checks, generate test coverage files, and create `.mbti` files."
msgstr "或者，可以使用 `ready_to_pr.sh` 脚本来自动格式化代码、运行检查、生成测试覆盖率文件和 `.mbti` 文件。"

#: manual/contributing.md:21
msgid "2. Naming conventions"
msgstr "2. 命名约定"

#: manual/contributing.md:23
msgid "2.1 Variable naming"
msgstr "2.1 变量命名"

#: manual/contributing.md:25
msgid "Use **lowercase letters with underscores** as separators (e.g., `my_var`)."
msgstr "采用 **小写字母和下划线** 分隔（例如：`my_var`）。"

#: manual/contributing.md:26
msgid "Variable names should be descriptive and clearly indicate their purpose."
msgstr "变量名应具有描述性，能够准确反映其用途。"

#: manual/contributing.md:28
msgid "2.2 Function naming"
msgstr "2.2 函数命名"

#: manual/contributing.md:30
msgid "Use **lowercase letters with underscores** as separators (e.g., `calc_total_price()`)."
msgstr "使用 **小写字母和下划线** 分隔（例如：`calc_total_price()`）。"

#: manual/contributing.md:31
msgid "Function names should be concise and descriptive, clearly expressing their functionality."
msgstr "函数名应简洁且具有描述性，能够清晰表达函数的功能。"

#: manual/contributing.md:33
msgid "2.3 Struct and trait naming"
msgstr "2.3 Struct 和 Trait 命名"

#: manual/contributing.md:35
msgid "Use **PascalCase** (e.g., `MyStruct`, `MyTrait`)."
msgstr "使用 **首字母大写的驼峰式命名**（例如：`MyStruct`、`MyTrait`）。"

#: manual/contributing.md:36
msgid "Names should intuitively reflect the function or role of the struct or trait, avoiding overly abstract or non-descriptive names."
msgstr "命名应直观地反映该结构体或特征的功能或角色，避免使用过于抽象或不具描述性的名称。"

#: manual/contributing.md:38
msgid "2.4 Constant naming"
msgstr "2.4 常量命名"

#: manual/contributing.md:40
msgid "**Note:** In the MoonBit context, \"variables\" are typically referred to as \"bindings\" and are immutable by default unless marked with `mut`. Thus, there is no strict distinction between constant and variable naming."
msgstr "**注意：** 由于在 MoonBit 的语境下，“变量”通常称为“binding”，且默认是不可变的，只有添加 `mut` 关键字才能使其可变。因此，常量和“变量”之间没有严格的命名差异，保持一致性。"

#: manual/contributing.md:41
msgid "Use **lowercase letters with underscores** as separators (e.g., `machine_dbl_epsilon`)."
msgstr "常量名采用 **全小写字母和下划线** 分隔（例如：`machine_dbl_epsilon`）。"

#: manual/contributing.md:42
msgid "Prefix constants with a descriptive category where applicable (e.g., `machine_dbl_epsilon`, where `machine` indicates a machine-related constant)."
msgstr "常量名通常以第一个单词作为前缀，表示常量的用途或分类。例如，`machine_dbl_epsilon` 中的 `machine` 表示与机器相关的常量。"

#: manual/contributing.md:43
msgid "Constant names should be concise and descriptive to facilitate understanding."
msgstr "常量名应简洁且具有描述性，便于其他开发者理解。"

#: manual/contributing.md:45
msgid "2.5 Result Err construction and Err code"
msgstr "2.5 Result 的 Err 构造内容和 Err Code"

#: manual/contributing.md:47
msgid "Use **uppercase letters with underscores** as separators (e.g., `E_MAX_ITER`)."
msgstr "采用 **全大写字母和下划线** 分隔（例如：`E_MAX_ITER`）。"

#: manual/contributing.md:48
msgid "Err codes should be prefixed with `E` to indicate an error-related construct."
msgstr "构造内容通常以字符`E`作为前缀，表示其用于 Err 构造或者错误代码。"

#: manual/contributing.md:49
msgid "Err codes should be concise and descriptive for easy comprehension."
msgstr "构造内容应简洁且具有描述性，便于其他开发者理解。"

#: manual/contributing.md:51
msgid "3. Comments"
msgstr "3. 注释"

#: manual/contributing.md:53
msgid "**Conciseness**: Comments should be clear and to the point, avoiding unnecessary verbosity."
msgstr "**简洁性**：注释应简洁明了，只包含必要的信息，避免冗长和不相关的内容。"

#: manual/contributing.md:54
msgid "**Consistency**: Use uniform terminology and style across the codebase."
msgstr "**一致性**：使用一致的术语和风格，避免在不同地方使用不同的方式描述相同的概念。"

#: manual/contributing.md:55
msgid "**Clarity**: Ensure comments are easy to understand, avoiding complex jargon or ambiguous wording."
msgstr "**清晰性**：确保注释易于理解，避免复杂的术语或模糊的表述。应使任何阅读代码的人能够快速理解注释的意图。"

#: manual/contributing.md:56
msgid "**Accuracy**: Comments must accurately reflect the functionality and purpose of the code."
msgstr "**准确性**：注释必须准确反映代码的功能和目的，避免与代码行为不符的描述。"

#: manual/contributing.md:57
msgid "**Up-to-date**: Comments should be updated alongside code changes to maintain relevance."
msgstr "**更新性**：随着代码的变更，注释也应随时更新，确保注释与代码同步。"

#: manual/contributing.md:59
msgid "Developers are encouraged to use MoonBit LSP’s AI-generated code comments to improve efficiency, but AI-generated comments should be reviewed to ensure correctness."
msgstr "我们鼓励开发者采用 MoonBit LSP 提供的 AI 代码注释生成来提升注释的编写效率，但需要开发者对 AI 生成的内容进行审核，以确保其对方法、结构体和特征的解释是正确无误的。"

#: manual/contributing.md:61
msgid "4. File standards"
msgstr "4. 文件规范"

#: manual/contributing.md:63
msgid "4.1 Folder naming"
msgstr "4.1 文件夹命名"

#: manual/contributing.md:65
msgid "Use **lowercase letters** for folder names."
msgstr "对于大的功能模块，请使用小写字母命名的文件夹（包）。"

#: manual/contributing.md:66
msgid "Folder names should be concise, descriptive, and separated using underscores (`_`). Avoid numbers and special characters."
msgstr "文件夹名称应简洁、具有描述性，并使用下划线（`_`）分隔单词。请避免使用数字和特殊字符。"

#: manual/contributing.md:68
#: manual/contributing.md:78
#: manual/contributing.md:94
msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "例如："

#: manual/contributing.md:70
msgid "For differentiation-related functionality: `diff`"
msgstr "微分相关功能：`diff`"

#: manual/contributing.md:71
msgid "For derivative-related functionality: `deriv`"
msgstr "导数相关功能：`deriv`"

#: manual/contributing.md:73
msgid "4.2 File organization"
msgstr "4.2 文件划分"

#: manual/contributing.md:75
msgid "Files should be organized based on functionality, with each file focusing on a specific feature. Use **lowercase letters with underscores** for file names."
msgstr "文件应该按功能划分，每个文件专注于特定的功能。文件名使用**小写字母和下划线**。"

#: manual/contributing.md:76
msgid "File names should be descriptive and clearly indicate the core functionality they implement."
msgstr "文件名应具备描述性，清楚反映该文件所实现的核心功能。"

#: manual/contributing.md:80
msgid "`gauss_kronrod.mbt`: Implements Gaussian quadrature with Kronrod extension."
msgstr "`gauss_kronrod.mbt`：实现带克龙罗德扩展的高斯求积。"

#: manual/contributing.md:81
msgid "`adaptive_quadrature_gk.mbt`: Implements adaptive quadrature using Gaussian quadrature with Kronrod extension."
msgstr "`adaptive_quadrature_gk.mbt`：使用带克龙罗德扩展的高斯求积实现的自适应积分。"

#: manual/contributing.md:83
msgid "**Note:** Avoid overly generic or vague file names such as `utils.mbt`. Instead, ensure file names correspond to their function or module."
msgstr "**注意**：在文件命名中（除了在@internal 中不可避免的情况），请避免使用过于通用或模糊的名称，如 `utils.mbt`，请尽量使文件名与其功能或模块相关联。"

#: manual/contributing.md:85
msgid "5. Commit guidelines"
msgstr "5. 提交规范"

#: manual/contributing.md:87
msgid "5.1 Commit messages"
msgstr "5.1 提交信息"

#: manual/contributing.md:89
msgid "Use the `ready_to_pr.sh` script before committing to format code, run checks, generate test coverage files, and create `.mbti` files."
msgstr "在提交前请使用 `ready_to_pr.sh` 脚本来自动格式化代码、运行检查、生成测试覆盖率文件和 `.mbti` 文件。"

#: manual/contributing.md:90
msgid "Each commit should have a clear description of the changes made."
msgstr "每个提交应具有清晰的描述，说明此次提交所做的变更。"

#: manual/contributing.md:91
msgid "Commit messages should be in **English**, concise, and precise."
msgstr "提交信息应使用**英文**，并遵循**简短、精炼**的原则。"

#: manual/contributing.md:92
msgid "Use prefixes such as `fix:`, `feat:`, `refactor:`, and `doc:` to indicate the type of change."
msgstr "使用 `fix:`，`feat:`，`refactor:` 和 `doc:` 等前缀来区分提交的类型"

#: manual/contributing.md:103
msgid "5.2 Commit frequency"
msgstr "5.2 提交频率"

#: manual/contributing.md:105
msgid "Keep commits small and focused on a single feature or fix."
msgstr "尽量保持每次提交都很小且聚焦于一个功能或修复。"

#: manual/contributing.md:106
msgid "Avoid large, monolithic commits that include multiple unrelated changes."
msgstr "不要一次性提交大规模的更改。"

#: manual/contributing.md:108
msgid "6. Code review"
msgstr "6. 代码审查"

#: manual/contributing.md:110
msgid "If you are not a maintainer or collaborator, contact them before modifying dependencies or version numbers in `moon.mod.json`."
msgstr "非项目维护者和合作者在修改`moon.mod.json`内的依赖和版本号前，请先联系维护者或者合作者。"

#: manual/contributing.md:111
msgid "All code submissions must undergo **code review**."
msgstr "所有的代码提交都必须经过**代码审查**。"

#: manual/contributing.md:112
msgid "Code reviews should focus on code quality, style, performance, and security."
msgstr "在审查过程中，关注代码质量、风格、性能和安全性。"

#: manual/contributing.md:113
msgid "Reviewers should provide constructive feedback to improve the code."
msgstr "审查者应提供建设性的反馈，帮助改进代码。"

#: manual/index.md:1
msgid "calculus-numerical"
msgstr "calculus-numerical"

#: manual/index.md:3
