#~ msgid "Since the project primarily focuses on numerical solutions related to calculus, documentation in this project is not only the foundation for sustainable development but also a key medium for helping developers understand and apply numerical solving methods, while also enabling them to deeply master the implementation and application of algorithms. Improving and updating the documentation is an ongoing effort, requiring continuous contributions from the community. Whether it is detailed algorithm explanations or tutorials and usage instructions for beginners, every small improvement will greatly enhance the accessibility and maintainability of the project. Therefore, we sincerely invite all developers to participate, especially those who are already familiar with various numerical computation libraries. Their experience will provide valuable insights for improving the quality of the documentation. We also encourage beginners to contribute to writing and refining the documentation, as it will not only help them better understand the project but also deepen their understanding of calculus and numerical computation through their contributions. Through joint effort, we believe that the project documentation will become a driving force for the growth of every contributor in the community, helping the project progress further in the future."
#~ msgstr "由于项目主要涉及微积分相关的数值解法，文档在本项目中不仅是可持续发展的基础，更是帮助开发者理解并应用数值求解方法、深入掌握算法实现与应用的关键媒介。"

#~ msgid "Feature Implementation"
#~ msgstr "功能实现"

#~ msgid "This project primarily focuses on implementing numerical solutions for calculus. In the next few versions, the focus will shift primarily to integration. Therefore, only integration-related functions are listed below. Below is a table of function name components and their meanings:"
#~ msgstr "本项目主要集中在微积分的数值解法实现上。在接下来的几个版本中，重点将主要转向积分。因此，下面仅列出了与积分相关的函数。"

#~ msgid "**Component**"
#~ msgstr "**组成部分**"

#~ msgid "Double (e.g., doubly adaptive, indicating multiple levels of adaptation)."
#~ msgstr "双重（例如，双重自适应，表示多层适应）。"

#~ msgid "Adaptive (dynamic adjustment of strategy, e.g., error control or interval subdivision)."
#~ msgstr "自适应（动态调整策略，例如，误差控制或区间细分）。"

#~ msgid "General-purpose (suitable for a wide range of problems)."
#~ msgstr "通用（适用于广泛问题）。"

#~ msgid "Oscillatory (handling functions with oscillatory behavior)."
#~ msgstr "振荡（处理具有振荡行为的函数）。"

#~ msgid "Singularities (handling functions with singular points)."
#~ msgstr "奇异点（处理具有奇异点的函数）。"

#~ msgid "Weighted (handling functions with specific weight functions)."
#~ msgstr "加权（处理具有特定权重函数的函数）。"

#~ msgid "Quadrature (numerical integration)."
#~ msgstr "求积（数值积分）。"

#~ msgid "Cauchy Principal Value (handling singularities or infinite intervals)."
#~ msgstr "Cauchy 主值（处理奇异点或无限区间）。"

#~ msgid "Fourier (specific oscillatory properties, often related to Fourier transforms)."
#~ msgstr "傅里叶（特定的振荡性质，通常与傅里叶变换相关）。"

#~ msgid "Gauss-Kronrod (a specific numerical integration method)."
#~ msgstr "高斯-克龙罗德（特定的数值积分方法）。"

#~ msgid "Simpson’s rule (a numerical integration method with higher accuracy)."
#~ msgstr "辛普森法（具有较高精度的数值积分方法）。"

#~ msgid "Trapezoidal rule (a basic numerical integration method)."
#~ msgstr "梯形法（基本的数值积分方法）。"

